<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 155 0 R
/T (For dog owners who see their pets as part of the family, My Boy Boone is a dog apparel brand that celebrates the bond between dogs and their owners. Through its dog hoodie product and a social media presence centered on humor, relatable pet-owner experiences, and community participation, My Boy Boone aims to stand out from competitors that rely heavily on traditional product-focused content. The brand makes dog apparel part of a fun, personal lifestyle that dog owners can connect with and share.)
/E (For dog owners who see their pets as part of the family, My Boy Boone is a dog apparel brand that celebrates the bond between dogs and their owners. Through its dog hoodie product and a social media presence centered on humor, relatable pet-owner experiences, and community participation, My Boy Boone aims to stand out from competitors that rely heavily on traditional product-focused content. The brand makes dog apparel part of a fun, personal lifestyle that dog owners can connect with and share.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [44]
>>
