/Title (Our overall social media strategy focuses on building a fun, community-driven online presence that feels like hanging out with fellow dog lovers rather than pushing a product. Instead of relying on traditional ads, we use lighthearted humor, relatable dog-parent moments, and photos submitted by our community to highlight our signature dog hoodie in real life. By keeping our content playful, warm, and interactive through polls, feature posts, and everyday dog struggles, we create an authentic brand experience that dog owners actually want to engage with and share.)
